		{
			dependencies: ["517B7F00DBF738E2"]
			description: [
				"Iron can be further processed in a furnace to create Wrought Iron. This is a harder version of the metal that can be used for stronger tools and is used machine parts later on. "
				""
				"Seasoned GregTech players will be happy to know that you DON'T have to smelt nuggets, smelting Iron Ingots in a furnace will yield a Hot Iron Ingot, which can be hammered into Wrought Iron from there."
				""
				"Do not convert your entire Iron supply into Wrought Iron, they are not interchangeable."
			]
			id: "66CAE1FC47A86D12"
